{"seq":4,"slug":"microservices-architecture","title":"微服务架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 微服务架构 简介\n\n微服务架构是一种将应用程序构建为一组小型、自治服务的架构风格，每个服务围绕特定业务能力构建，可独立开发、部署和扩展。这种架构模式在大规模分布式系统中得到了广泛应用，是云原生应用设计的核心方法论。\n\n本手册面向有分布式系统开发经验的工程师和架构师，系统讲解微服务架构的设计模式、通信机制和数据管理策略。读者将学会如何在实际项目中合理拆分服务、设计通信协议，并有效管理分布式数据的一致性。\n\n全书共分为四章，从架构设计到技术实现全面覆盖：\n\n第一章**微服务模式**探讨服务拆分的策略与边界划分方法，介绍 API 网关模式的设计思路，并深入讲解 Saga 模式在分布式事务中的应用。\n\n第二章**服务通信**对比同步通信（REST 与 gRPC）和异步消息（事件驱动）两种主流通信范式，并讨论服务契约的管理与版本演进策略。\n\n第三章**服务网格**介绍服务网格的核心概念与架构设计，以 Istio 为例讲解流量管理的实践方法，并探讨网格层面的可观测性与安全策略。\n\n第四章**数据管理**聚焦微服务架构下的数据治理难题，从每服务一数据库模式到事件溯源与 CQRS，再到跨服务数据一致性的保障策略。\n\n建议读者先理解微服务的设计原则和拆分方法，再结合具体技术栈深入通信与数据管理的细节，在实践中逐步积累架构经验。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"microservices-patterns","title":"微服务模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decomposition-strategies","title":"微服务拆分策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns/decomposition-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-gateway-pattern","title":"API 网关模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns/api-gateway-pattern"},{"seq":3,"slug":"saga-pattern","title":"Saga 分布式事务模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns/saga-pattern"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"service-communication","title":"服务通信","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-communication","title":"同步通信模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-communication/sync-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-messaging","title":"异步消息通信","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-communication/async-messaging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-contracts","title":"服务契约与 API 治理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-communication/service-contracts"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"service-mesh","title":"服务网格","docCount":5,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-mesh-concepts","title":"服务网格核心概念","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-mesh-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"istio-linkerd","title":"Istio 与 Linkerd 实战","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-linkerd"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mesh-observability","title":"服务网格可观测性","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/mesh-observability"},{"seq":4,"slug":"istio-practice","title":"Istio 服务网格实践","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-practice"},{"seq":5,"slug":"service-discovery-lb","title":"服务发现与负载均衡","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-discovery-lb"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"microservices-data","title":"数据管理","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"database-decomposition","title":"数据库拆分策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/database-decomposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-sourcing","title":"事件溯源模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/event-sourcing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-consistency","title":"数据一致性模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/data-consistency"},{"seq":4,"slug":"database-per-service","title":"每服务一数据库模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/microservices-data/database-per-service"}]}]}